Owner decision OD-DLP001-R3. PostgreSQL must be a fresh local ephemeral cluster created only with initdb/pg_ctl, with listen_addresses empty and Unix-domain socket connection only. No TCP listener, environment-provided DATABASE_URL, existing application database, remote/staging/development/production database, Docker/remote fallback, credential read or external API. If local PostgreSQL binaries or isolation proof are unavailable, report BLOCKED and stop; do not install PostgreSQL or fall back without a new governance decision.

Owner decision OD-DLP001-R4. Repository functions are limited to acquireWriteLease, renewWriteLease, releaseWriteLease and validateWriteLease using an injected DB client. The disposable schema must enforce one canonical WRITE owner per (resource_type, resource_key), a database-issued monotonic fencing epoch that cannot reset through row deletion/recreation, DB-clock expiry, expected_version compare-and-swap, and stale/foreign actor or governance-revision DENY. No generic SQL runner, network listener, TECP main-service integration or prompt-asserted worker identity.

Owner decision OD-DLP001-R5. Required tests: two and ten-plus independent simultaneous contenders; exactly one committed owner; idempotent replay and conflicting-key DENY; stale fencing epoch; foreign actor renew/release DENY; mid-transaction rollback; database outage; invalid governance revision; and no partial/ghost state. All failures fail closed.

Owner decision OD-DLP001-R6. The proof is disposable test evidence only. Without immutable audit and trusted Worker authentication it remains NON_OPERATIONAL. No TECP worker, MCP action tool, multi-Cursor pilot, 3–5 Agent stress, migration 057, canonical schema mutation, backend integration, deploy or Production mutation is authorized.

Owner decision OD-DLP001-R7. After implementation, the exact six-file diff, dependency audit, disposable database isolation, concurrency/fencing logs, focused tests, full frozen TECP regression and owner Human QA must pass on the exact commit. A separate governance closeout must consume this authorization. No CI PASS is presumed.

